        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667520/extras/694dc75a4f2657579d819d18e5b340ff.avif?t=1772820989\" alt=\"Description\" width=616 height=196 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last one Standing</strong> is a 2D <strong>couch fighting game</strong>, where each round brings new rules that change the weapons, the players or even the world itself !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a sword and melee your neighbor to the death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a baseball bat, and teach him why people usually avoid falling into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you would prefer a more subtle approach ? Like forcing your enemies to run into lava or presenting them to your recenlty acquired rocket launcher ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what, the choice is yours. In Last One Standing, you fight in enclosed arenas, avoid traps and try to kill everyone else, because only one thing counts : dying less often than your friends and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667520/extras/0515eefd269d6209e411b55d2ed4c16b.avif?t=1772820989\" alt=\"Human and AI Players\" width=616 height=196 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friends are salty about their last defeat ? Or maybe you are looking for your player 2 ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long are gone the days where you had to convince real people to come and play with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With just a single click, you can replace any meat-controlled player by a completely fair AI player ! And if you are too tired of winning, you can even choose to let the AI play between themselves !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a cup of tea, start a new game, and watch 4 AI players battle to the death while you enjoy much more refined life delicacies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667520/extras/dda810ff35313de7aaf482b8190ee16d.avif?t=1772820989\" alt=\"Features\" width=616 height=196 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 players with full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional rules between rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(tea not included)</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667520/extras/694dc75a4f2657579d819d18e5b340ff.avif?t=1772820989\" alt=\"Description\" width=616 height=196 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Last one Standing</strong> is a 2D <strong>couch fighting game</strong>, where each round brings new rules that change the weapons, the players or even the world itself !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a sword and melee your neighbor to the death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a baseball bat, and teach him why people usually avoid falling into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe you would prefer a more subtle approach ? Like forcing your enemies to run into lava or presenting them to your recenlty acquired rocket launcher ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what, the choice is yours. In Last One Standing, you fight in enclosed arenas, avoid traps and try to kill everyone else, because only one thing counts : dying less often than your friends and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667520/extras/0515eefd269d6209e411b55d2ed4c16b.avif?t=1772820989\" alt=\"Human and AI Players\" width=616 height=196 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friends are salty about their last defeat ? Or maybe you are looking for your player 2 ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long are gone the days where you had to convince real people to come and play with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With just a single click, you can replace any meat-controlled player by a completely fair AI player ! And if you are too tired of winning, you can even choose to let the AI play between themselves !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a cup of tea, start a new game, and watch 4 AI players battle to the death while you enjoy much more refined life delicacies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667520/extras/dda810ff35313de7aaf482b8190ee16d.avif?t=1772820989\" alt=\"Features\" width=616 height=196 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-4 players with full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional rules between rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(tea not included)</p>",
